    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Blocky with super high jumping height in this 2D adventure platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new worlds where Blocky's abilities change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the ability to always jump, float in the air, always move right,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and other abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world map with levels to complete to continue your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many worlds with new gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 130 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Float in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.poster.avif?t=1745262898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.webm?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.mp4?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/b61c39deb2ba06725c1e7e9858fdbaba.poster.avif?t=1745262898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/b61c39deb2ba06725c1e7e9858fdbaba.webm?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/b61c39deb2ba06725c1e7e9858fdbaba.mp4?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/a4e7b2acf2858e6f62df63f2a092765f.poster.avif?t=1745262898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/a4e7b2acf2858e6f62df63f2a092765f.webm?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/a4e7b2acf2858e6f62df63f2a092765f.mp4?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Blocky with super high jumping height in this 2D adventure platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new worlds where Blocky's abilities change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the ability to always jump, float in the air, always move right,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and other abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world map with levels to complete to continue your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many worlds with new gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 130 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Float in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.poster.avif?t=1745262898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.webm?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/12161e05d7e561ee9633183546946eaf.mp4?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/b61c39deb2ba06725c1e7e9858fdbaba.poster.avif?t=1745262898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677650/extras/b61c39deb2ba06725c1e7e9858fdbaba.webm?t=1745262898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share